    "description": "Spring Boot configuration with database pool, borrowing policy defaults, and JPA",
    "content": "# ==============================================================================\n# SmartLib Application Configuration (Stage 1: Foundation)\n# ==============================================================================\n\n# Application Meta\nspring.application.name=smartlib\nserver.port=${SERVER_PORT:8080}\n\n# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------\n# MySQL Database Connection (via Environment Variables)\n# Defaults to localhost:3306/smartlib_db if host/port/name are not overridden.\n# DB_USERNAME and DB_PASSWORD MUST be supplied via environment variables.\n# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------\nspring.datasource.url=jdbc:mysql://${DB_HOST:localhost}:${DB_PORT:3306}/${DB_NAME:smartlib_db}?useSSL=false&allowPublicKeyRetrieval=true&serverTimezone=UTC&characterEncoding=UTF-8\nspring.datasource.username=${DB_USERNAME:root}\nspring.datasource.password=${DB_PASSWORD:}\nspring.datasource.driver-class-name=com.mysql.cj.jdbc.Driver\n\n# Fail-Fast Database Validation on Startup\n# HikariCP fails application startup immediately if MySQL is unreachable.\nspring.datasource.hikari.connection-timeout=5000\nspring.datasource.hikari.validation-timeout=3000\nspring.datasource.hikari.initialization-fail-timeout=1\nspring.datasource.hikari.maximum-pool-size=10\nspring.datasource.hikari.minimum-idle=2\n\n# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------\n# JPA / Hibernate Configuration for Development\n# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------\nspring.jpa.database-platform=org.hibernate.dialect.MySQLDialect\nspring.jpa.hibernate.ddl-auto=update\nspring.jpa.show-sql=true\nspring.jpa.properties.hibernate.format_sql=true\nspring.jpa.properties.hibernate.highlight_sql=true\nspring.jpa.open-in-view=false\n\n# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------\n# Thymeleaf Template Engine Configuration\n# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------\nspring.thymeleaf.prefix=classpath:/templates/\nspring.thymeleaf.suffix=.html\nspring.thymeleaf.mode=HTML\nspring.thymeleaf.encoding=UTF-8\nspring.thymeleaf.cache=false\nspring.thymeleaf.check-template-location=true\n\n# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------\n# Static Resources Configuration (CSS, JS, Images)\n# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------\nspring.web.resources.static-locations=classpath:/static/\nspring.web.resources.cache.period=0\n\n# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------\n# Borrowing Policy Configuration (Stage 4)\n# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------\nsmartlib.borrowing.max-loans=${MAX_LOANS:3}\nsmartlib.borrowing.loan-duration-days=${LOAN_DURATION_DAYS:14}\n\n# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------\n# Logging\n# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------\nlogging.level.root=INFO\nlogging.level.com.smartlib=DEBUG\nlogging.level.org.hibernate.SQL=DEBUG\nlogging.level.org.hibernate.type.descriptor.sql.BasicBinder=TRACE\nlogging.level.com.zaxxer.hikari=DEBUG\n"
